了主食天婦羅外，還附有白飯、味噌湯、沙拉生生菜絲、醃漬小菜和沾醬，份量上十分充足。\n天婦羅表現：\n炸功與麵衣表現穩定，金黃酥脆。不過在食材搭配上，個人覺得天婦羅的油炸烹調方式，依然最適合海鮮類（如蝦子）和蔬菜類。海鮮能保持鮮甜，蔬菜則能藉由油炸鎖住水分、帶出清甜；相較之下，套餐內其他肉類食材做成天婦羅，驚艷感就稍微平淡了一些。\n環境與服務：\n店內環境乾淨舒適，上菜速度適中。如果想一次嘗試多種不同食材的人，這款台灣限定的 All Star 套餐是不錯的綜合選擇，但若特別偏好傳統天婦羅風味，建議可以直接專攻海鮮或蔬菜量較多的品項。",null,[0,82]]]],[null,1781175518000000,1781175518000000,"2 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfSGZZTUg4ZU1IdjJhb05SNnRNN2JTQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfSGZZTUg4ZU1IdjJhb05SNnRNN2JTQRoTQ2d3STNxbXEwUVlRbnZYUm1BRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjZrP--xtKWAxWnnq8BHfDRJTAQ_2MImgEoEQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1UjFRd1JuTmlWbGsxVFRBMWFrNHpiRmhVV0doTlpVaG9kVkl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1UjFRd1JuTmlWbGsxVFRBMWFrNHpiRmhVV0doTlpVaG9kVkl3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1UjFRd1JuTmlWbGsxVFRBMWFrNHpiRmhVV0doTlpVaG9kVkl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1UjFRd1JuTmlWbGsxVFRBMWFrNHpiRmhVV0doTlpVaG9kVkl3UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1UjFRd1JuTmlWbGsxVFRBMWFrNHpiRmhVV0doTlpVaG9kVkl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1UjFRd1JuTmlWbGsxVFRBMWFrNHpiRmhVV0doTlpVaG9kVkl3UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["L謝謝您的推薦！🙏\n丼飯是我們的招牌餐點，歡迎您下次再來品嚐其他口味！\n感謝您的光臨和寶貴意見。\n我們重視每一位客人的回饋，會努力改進以提供更優質的服務。\n期待您再次光臨!",null,[0,48]]]],[null,null,3717,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m