xtKWAxWnnq8BHfDRJTAQ3IcHCK0BKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n每次來到 大遠百 逛街，幾乎都會忍不住直奔 天吉屋！身為日料控，尤其熱愛天婦羅的我，真的覺得這裡是平價又好吃的首選 💛\n他們家的天婦羅外酥內嫩，炸功拿捏得剛剛好，完全不油膩，每一口都吃得到食材的新鮮與層次感。重點是價格親民，CP值超高，想吃好一點又不想傷荷包，來這裡準沒錯！\n這次點了雙拼拉麵👍，份量很有誠意，搭配酥脆天婦羅真的超滿足，湯頭濃郁不死鹹，吃完整個幸福感爆棚～\n假日的 大遠百 人潮眾多，但服務人員依然保持親切有禮的態度，動作俐落又貼心，讓人用餐體驗非常舒服。忙碌中還能保持笑容，真的值得大大加分 👏",null,[0,143]]]],[null,1771590184000000,1771590184000000,"6 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfbDVIcnl0cnNkMlh5ZVI0TEhJQnpzZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfbDVIcnl0cnNkMlh5ZVI0TEhJQnpzZxoTQ2d3SXFLVGh6QVlRLXJfOW9BTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjZrP--xtKWAxWnnq8BHfDRJTAQ_2MIrwEoCw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYW1SdWNFOVVWVzk1WkRKa2VsRXpiRmxVUjNobVRrVlNlazVGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYW1SdWNFOVVWVzk1WkRKa2VsRXpiRmxVUjNobVRrVlNlazVGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYW1SdWNFOVVWVzk1WkRKa2VsRXpiRmxVUjNobVRrVlNlazVGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYW1SdWNFOVVWVzk1WkRKa2VsRXpiRmxVUjNobVRrVlNlazVGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYW1SdWNFOVVWVzk1WkRKa2VsRXpiRmxVUjNobVRrVlNlazVGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14407407580468397270/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYW1SdWNFOVVWVzk1WkRKa2VsRXpiRmxVUjNobVRrVlNlazVGUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["Tracy我們的日式料理餐廳是您中午放鬆用餐的最佳選擇！\n謝謝您的支持，歡迎下次再來！",null,[0,43]]]],[null,null